USE GRAPH Mule_Pattern_Learner

/* How the account's network formed, B6 (docs/design.md, "read_community (B6): how the mule
   network formed", and docs/features.md, "The community block"): for each account of the
   request at one Monday t, the community of customers around its owner as of t, and the 8
   numbers of its block.

   The members, each in the first round that reaches it:
   - round 0 is the scored account's owner, through a visible ownership link. An account with
     none has no member, and every number of its block is 0;
   - round 1 adds the customers that share a device or IP that is no leaf with the owner, and
     round 2 those that share one with a member kept in round 1;
   - the payment round adds the owners, through a visible ownership link, of internal
     accounts that exist at t and are no hub and that paid, or were paid by, an account of a
     member kept in rounds 0 to 2 in [t - 30 days, t).
   Each round's candidates are kept newest first, ties by customer id, while the community
   holds fewer than 64. A sharing candidate's time is the latest, over the nodes it shares
   with a member kept in the round before, of the later of the two sharing starts; a payment
   candidate's time is its latest such payment. One heap per scored account, ordered by round,
   then newest first, then by id, with the community's cap as its capacity, keeps exactly
   these members whatever order the candidates come in. capped says that some candidate was
   left out: more were proposed, the owner included, than the heap holds.

   Sharing is read_shared_identity's rule (B5). A customer shares a node that is no leaf when
   it has a link to it held in the last 30 days, or a deposit account it owns, existing at t
   through a visible ownership link, sent a payment seen on it in the last 30 days. Its
   sharing start there is the earliest of its link start (the earliest start of its visible
   links to the node) and its first use seen from such an account in the lookback, each
   t - 90 days when it is not known. A start s is known when s > t - 90 days, s > its
   joined_ms, and an account it owns through a visible ownership link sent a payment in
   [t - 90 days, s) not seen on that node. Every device and IP a customer shares is tested
   inline by read_hubs' crowd rule: one with more than 8 customers is a leaf, shared by no one
   and never stepped through.

   The rounds run in one loop of five passes. Each pass first reads the sharing of the
   customers handed to it that no pass has read yet: their links, their own payments of the
   lookback and the nodes seen on them, their sharing starts, and the leaf test of the nodes
   they share. Then pass 1 proposes round 1's candidates, pass 2 round 2's, each from the
   nodes of the members kept in the round before, and pass 3 the payment round's; every pass
   then keeps its round's members in the heaps (pass 0 keeps the owners, round 0). Passes 0
   and 1 hand the next pass the customers that share a node of the members they kept, so
   that each candidate of rounds 1 and 2 is read before it is proposed; passes 2 and 3 hand
   it the members they kept, so that pass 4 reads the payment round's members.

   The block (docs/features.md, "The community block"):
   - members: the members kept, the owner included; capped, as above.
   - shared_nodes: the nodes that are no leaf and that two members or more share. A link is a
     member sharing one of them; density is the links over members times shared nodes, 0 with
     no shared node. The payment round adds members, never links.
   - new_link_share_30d: the links whose member's sharing start there is in the last 30 days,
     over the links; 0 with none.
   - A member's accounts exist at t through a visible ownership link, open or closed, and are
     no hub. A payment of the last 30 days between accounts of two different members is
     internal, and its cents, floor(amount x 100 + 0.5) summed in INT, make
     internal_amount_30d; one between a member's account and any other account, an account
     hub included, is external; one between two accounts of one member is neither.
     isolation is the internal payments over internal and external ones, 0 with none, and
     member_payments_30d is their sum.
   A self-payment is read nowhere but in the crowd count, which is read_hubs' measure. No
   library algorithm builds the community: those read the whole graph with no as-of time.

   Per-request state is kept by the scored account: on its own vertex, or in maps keyed by its
   id. Every other map and flag holds what one customer, account, node or payment is at t,
   whichever scored account reached it, so that a customer read or a node tested once is read
   or tested for every scored account. The account hubs of t come as hub_accounts, read_hubs'
   account hubs of the same t; each must exist at t. Reads no label. t must be a Monday at
   00:00 UTC after the lookback's length, and the request must name at least one account,
   each once, each in the graph and existing at t; the accounts come as ids, as
   read_money_flow says why. */
CREATE OR REPLACE QUERY read_community(
    UINT t_ms,
    LIST<STRING> account_ids,
    SET<VERTEX<Account>> hub_accounts
) FOR GRAPH Mule_Pattern_Learner SYNTAX V2 {
    /* A member of a community: the round that reached it, its time, and its id. */
    TYPEDEF TUPLE<INT round_number, UINT ts, STRING id> Member;
    /* The account hubs; a customer whose sharing a pass has read, and a node it has tested. */
    OrAccum @hub, @read, @tested;
    /* A payment's sender's owner and its receiver, whether its sender is a deposit account,
       and the nodes it was seen on. */
    MaxAccum<STRING> @owner_id, @receiver_id;
    OrAccum @deposit_sender;
    SetAccum<STRING> @seen_on;
    /* A node's crowd count and leaf flag. */
    SetAccum<VERTEX<Party>> @crowd_customers;
    OrAccum @leaf;
    /* A scored account's community, by round, then newest first, then by id; how many
       customers were proposed to it, the owner included; per node that is no leaf, the
       members sharing it, and those whose sharing start there is in the last 30 days. */
    HeapAccum<Member>(64, round_number ASC, ts DESC, id ASC) @community;
    SumAccum<INT> @proposed;
    MapAccum<STRING, SumAccum<INT>> @node_links, @node_new_links;
    /* A member's account: the scored accounts whose community holds its owner, and its owner. */
    SetAccum<STRING> @communities;
    MaxAccum<STRING> @member_owner;
    /* The block. */
    SumAccum<INT> @members, @shared_nodes, @internal_amount_30d, @member_payments_30d;
    OrAccum @capped;
    SumAccum<DOUBLE> @density, @new_link_share_30d, @isolation;
    /* Per customer and node: the earliest start of its visible links, its earliest own payment
       not seen on the node, its first use from a deposit account, and its sharing start. Per
       customer: its earliest own payment in the lookback, the nodes its own payments were
       seen on, and the nodes it shares; per node, the customers sharing it; the leaves. */
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>>> @@link_start, @@first_unseen, @@dep_first,
      @@share_start;
    MapAccum<STRING, MinAccum<UINT>> @@first_own;
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@own_seen, @@shares, @@sharers;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@leaf_ids;
    /* Per scored account: its members, those kept in the last round, and the round's
       candidates with their times; per member, the scored accounts whose community holds it.
       Every member, the last round's members, and the nodes they share that are no leaf. */
    MapAccum<STRING, SetAccum<STRING>> @@members, @@frontier, @@member_of;
    MapAccum<STRING, MapAccum<STRING, MaxAccum<UINT>>> @@candidate_time;
    SetAccum<STRING> @@member_ids, @@frontier_ids, @@frontier_node_ids;
    /* Per scored account: its members' internal payments, their cents, and their external
       payments. */
    MapAccum<STRING, SumAccum<INT>> @@internal, @@internal_cents, @@external;
    /* The request's ids, each once, and how many it gave. */
    SetAccum<STRING> @@ids;
    SumAccum<INT> @@given;
    UINT lookback_ms = 7776000000;
    UINT crowd_threshold = 8;
    INT community_round = 0;

    /* Mondays are 4 days after the Thursday of 1970-01-01, modulo a week. */
    IF t_ms <= lookback_ms OR t_ms % 604800000 != 345600000 THEN
        PRINT "invalid_parameters" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    FOREACH account_id IN account_ids DO
        @@ids += account_id;
        @@given += 1;
    END;
    IF @@given == 0 THEN
        PRINT "invalid_parameters" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    IF @@ids.size() != @@given THEN
        PRINT "duplicate_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Requested = to_vertex_set(@@ids, "Account");
    IF Requested.size() != @@ids.size() THEN
        PRINT "unknown_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Scored = SELECT s FROM Requested:s WHERE s.opened_ms < t_ms;
    IF Scored.size() != Requested.size() THEN
        PRINT "invisible_account" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Hubs = {hub_accounts};
    HubAccounts = SELECT h FROM Hubs:h WHERE h.opened_ms < t_ms;
    IF HubAccounts.size() != Hubs.size() THEN
        PRINT "invisible_hub" AS status;
        RETURN;
    END;
    Marked = SELECT h FROM HubAccounts:h POST-ACCUM h.@hub += TRUE;

    /* Round 0: each scored account's owner, through a visible ownership link. */
    Owners = SELECT q FROM Scored:a -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
      WHERE o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
      ACCUM a.@community += Member(0, 0, q.id), a.@proposed += 1;
    Pending (ANY) = Owners;

    /* The five passes. */
    WHILE community_round < 5 DO
        @@candidate_time.clear();

        /* The customers handed to this pass that no pass has read; their visible links,
           with the earliest start per node, and the nodes they share through a link held in
           the last 30 days. */
        Fresh = SELECT q FROM Pending:q WHERE NOT q.@read POST-ACCUM q.@read += TRUE;
        FreshLinks = SELECT n FROM Fresh:q -((Party_Uses_Device>|Party_Uses_IP>):l)- (Device|IP):n
          WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
            AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
          ACCUM
            @@link_start += (q.id -> (n.id -> l.valid_from_ms)),
            IF l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
              AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - 2592000000) THEN
                @@shares += (q.id -> n.id),
                @@sharers += (n.id -> q.id)
            END;
        /* Their own payments sent in the lookback, but self-payments, from accounts that exist
           at t through a visible ownership link: the earliest, and per node seen on them the
           first from a deposit account, which also shares the node when in the last 30
           days. */
        FreshSent = SELECT p FROM Fresh:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
          -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
          (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
          -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
          WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
            AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
            AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
            AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
          ACCUM
            p.@owner_id += q.id,
            p.@deposit_sender += b.account_type == "deposit",
            @@first_own += (q.id -> p.event_ts_ms);
        FreshSeen = SELECT n FROM FreshSent:p
          -((Transaction_Used_Device>|Transaction_Used_IP>
            |Transfer_Used_Device>|Transfer_Used_IP>):u)- (Device|IP):n
          ACCUM
            p.@seen_on += n.id,
            @@own_seen += (p.@owner_id -> n.id),
            IF p.@deposit_sender THEN
                @@dep_first += (p.@owner_id -> (n.id -> p.event_ts_ms)),
                IF p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
                    @@shares += (p.@owner_id -> n.id),
                    @@sharers += (n.id -> p.@owner_id)
                END
            END;
        FreshUnseen = SELECT p FROM FreshSent:p
          POST-ACCUM
            FOREACH n IN @@own_seen.get(p.@owner_id) DO
                IF NOT p.@seen_on.contains(n) THEN
                    @@first_unseen += (p.@owner_id -> (n -> p.event_ts_ms))
                END
            END;
        /* Their sharing starts: a link start or a first use from a deposit account is known
           when it is after the lookback's start, after the customer joined, and after a
           payment of the customer's own not seen on the node; each is t - 90 days when not
           known, and the sharing start is the earliest. */
        FreshStarts = SELECT q FROM Fresh:q
          POST-ACCUM
            UINT unseen_ms = 0, BOOL found = FALSE,
            FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@link_start.get(q.id) DO
                IF @@own_seen.get(q.id).contains(n) THEN
                    found = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).containsKey(n),
                    unseen_ms = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).get(n)
                ELSE
                    found = @@first_own.containsKey(q.id),
                    unseen_ms = @@first_own.get(q.id)
                END,
                IF start_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms AND start_ms > q.joined_ms
                  AND found AND unseen_ms < start_ms THEN
                    @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> start_ms))
                ELSE
                    @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> t_ms - lookback_ms))
                END
            END,
            FOREACH (n, start_ms) IN @@dep_first.get(q.id) DO
                IF @@own_seen.get(q.id).contains(n) THEN
                    found = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).containsKey(n),
                    unseen_ms = @@first_unseen.get(q.id).get(n)
                ELSE
                    found = @@first_own.containsKey(q.id),
                    unseen_ms = @@first_own.get(q.id)
                END,
                IF start_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms AND start_ms > q.joined_ms
                  AND found AND unseen_ms < start_ms THEN
                    @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> start_ms))
                ELSE
                    @@share_start += (q.id -> (n -> t_ms - lookback_ms))
                END
            END;

        /* The leaves among the nodes they share that no pass has tested, by read_hubs' crowd
           rule; payments are read only for a node that 8 enrolled customers or fewer do not
           already make a leaf. */
        FreshNodes = FreshLinks UNION FreshSeen;
        Untested = SELECT n FROM FreshNodes:n
          WHERE @@sharers.containsKey(n.id) AND NOT n.@tested
          POST-ACCUM n.@tested += TRUE;
        EnrolledCrowd = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
          -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
          WHERE l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
            AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
          ACCUM d.@crowd_customers += q;
        SeenCrowd = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
          -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
            |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
          (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
          -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
          -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
          WHERE d.@crowd_customers.size() <= crowd_threshold
            AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - lookback_ms AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
            AND b.account_type == "deposit" AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
            AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
            AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
          ACCUM d.@crowd_customers += q;
        Leaves = SELECT d FROM Untested:d
          POST-ACCUM d.@leaf += d.@crowd_customers.size() > crowd_threshold;
        LeafIds = SELECT d FROM Untested:d WHERE d.@leaf POST-ACCUM @@leaf_ids += d.id;

        /* Rounds 1 and 2: on each node that is no leaf shared by a member kept in the round
           before, every customer sharing it that is no member yet, at the later of the two
           sharing starts, its latest over those nodes and members. */
        IF community_round == 1 OR community_round == 2 THEN
            Proposed = SELECT s FROM Scored:s
              POST-ACCUM
                UINT own_ms = 0, UINT other_ms = 0,
                FOREACH m IN @@frontier.get(s.id) DO
                    FOREACH n IN @@shares.get(m) DO
                        IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN
                            FOREACH c IN @@sharers.get(n) DO
                                IF NOT @@members.get(s.id).contains(c) THEN
                                    own_ms = @@share_start.get(m).get(n),
                                    other_ms = @@share_start.get(c).get(n),
                                    @@candidate_time += (s.id -> (c -> CASE
                                      WHEN own_ms > other_ms THEN own_ms ELSE other_ms END))
                                END
                            END
                        END
                    END
                END;
        END;
        /* The payment round: the owners, through a visible ownership link, of the internal
           accounts that exist at t and are no hub at the other end of a payment of the last
           30 days, but self-payments, of a member's account, that are no member yet, at
           their latest such payment. */
        IF community_round == 3 THEN
            PayingMembers = to_vertex_set(@@member_ids, "Party");
            Payees = SELECT c FROM PayingMembers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
              -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
              (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
              -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
              -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:c
              WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
                AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND NOT b.@hub
                AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
                AND NOT r.is_external AND NOT r.@hub AND r.opened_ms < t_ms
                AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
              ACCUM
                FOREACH s IN @@member_of.get(q.id) DO
                    IF NOT @@members.get(s).contains(c.id) THEN
                        @@candidate_time += (s -> (c.id -> p.event_ts_ms))
                    END
                END;
            Payers = SELECT c FROM PayingMembers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
              -((Account_Received_Transaction>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
              (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
              -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:r
              -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:c
              WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
                AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND NOT b.@hub
                AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
                AND NOT r.is_external AND NOT r.@hub AND r.opened_ms < t_ms
                AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
              ACCUM
                FOREACH s IN @@member_of.get(q.id) DO
                    IF NOT @@members.get(s).contains(c.id) THEN
                        @@candidate_time += (s -> (c.id -> p.event_ts_ms))
                    END
                END;
        END;

        /* The round's candidates into each scored account's heap, which keeps its members;
           then the members, and those this round kept. */
        Ranked = SELECT s FROM Scored:s
          POST-ACCUM
            FOREACH (customer, candidate_ms) IN @@candidate_time.get(s.id) DO
                s.@community += Member(community_round, candidate_ms, customer),
                s.@proposed += 1
            END;
        @@frontier.clear();
        @@frontier_ids.clear();
        Kept = SELECT s FROM Scored:s
          POST-ACCUM
            FOREACH x IN s.@community DO
                @@members += (s.id -> x.id),
                @@member_of += (x.id -> s.id),
                @@member_ids += x.id,
                IF x.round_number == community_round THEN
                    @@frontier += (s.id -> x.id),
                    @@frontier_ids += x.id
                END
            END;

        /* What the next pass reads: after passes 0 and 1, every customer sharing a node that
           is no leaf of the members just kept, through a link held in the last 30 days or a
           payment of the last 30 days, but self-payments, from a deposit account it owns
           that exists at t through a visible ownership link; after passes 2 and 3, the
           members just kept. */
        IF community_round < 2 THEN
            @@frontier_node_ids.clear();
            FOREACH m IN @@frontier_ids DO
                FOREACH n IN @@shares.get(m) DO
                    IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN
                        @@frontier_node_ids += n;
                    END;
                END;
            END;
            FrontierDevices = to_vertex_set(@@frontier_node_ids, "Device");
            FrontierIps = to_vertex_set(@@frontier_node_ids, "IP");
            FrontierNodes = FrontierDevices UNION FrontierIps;
            FrontierReceivers = SELECT p FROM FrontierNodes:d
              -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
                |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
              (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
              -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
              WHERE NOT d.@leaf
                AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
              ACCUM p.@receiver_id += r.id;
            LinkUsers = SELECT q FROM FrontierNodes:d
              -((Device_Used_By_Party>|IP_Used_By_Party>):l)- Party:q
              WHERE NOT d.@leaf AND l.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (l.valid_to_ms == 0 OR l.valid_to_ms > t_ms - 2592000000);
            SeenUsers = SELECT q FROM FrontierNodes:d
              -((Device_Used_By_Transaction>|IP_Observed_In_Transaction>
                |Device_Used_By_Transfer>|IP_Used_By_Transfer>):u)-
              (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
              -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:b
              -(Account_Owned_By_Party>:o)- Party:q
              WHERE NOT d.@leaf
                AND p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms
                AND b.account_type == "deposit" AND b.opened_ms < t_ms
                AND b.id != p.@receiver_id
                AND o.valid_from_ms < t_ms
                AND (o.valid_to_ms == 0 OR o.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms);
            Pending = LinkUsers UNION SeenUsers;
        ELSE
            Pending = to_vertex_set(@@frontier_ids, "Party");
        END;
        community_round = community_round + 1;
    END;

    /* The members' accounts: those that exist at t through a visible ownership link, open or
       closed, but hubs, each with the scored accounts whose community holds its owner. */
    AllMembers = to_vertex_set(@@member_ids, "Party");
    MemberAccounts = SELECT b FROM AllMembers:q -(Party_Owns_Account>:w)- Account:b
      WHERE w.valid_from_ms < t_ms
        AND (w.valid_to_ms == 0 OR w.valid_to_ms > t_ms - lookback_ms)
        AND b.opened_ms < t_ms AND NOT b.@hub
      ACCUM
        b.@member_owner += q.id,
        FOREACH s IN @@member_of.get(q.id) DO b.@communities += s END;
    /* Their payments of the last 30 days, but self-payments: one sent to an account of
       another member is internal, counted once from its sender, with its cents; one with an
       account of no member is external, counted from the member's side. */
    MemberSent = SELECT b FROM MemberAccounts:b
      -((Account_Initiated_Transaction>|Account_Sent_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_To_Account>|Transfer_To_Account>):f)- Account:r
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
      ACCUM
        INT cents = floor(p.amount * 100 + 0.5),
        FOREACH s IN b.@communities DO
            IF r.@communities.contains(s) THEN
                IF r.@member_owner != b.@member_owner THEN
                    @@internal += (s -> 1),
                    @@internal_cents += (s -> cents)
                END
            ELSE
                @@external += (s -> 1)
            END
        END;
    MemberReceived = SELECT b FROM MemberAccounts:b
      -((Account_Received_Transaction>|Account_Received_Zelle_Transfer>):e)-
      (Payment_Transaction|Zelle_Transfer):p
      -((Transaction_From_Account>|Transfer_From_Account>):f)- Account:r
      WHERE p.event_ts_ms >= t_ms - 2592000000 AND p.event_ts_ms < t_ms AND r != b
      ACCUM
        FOREACH s IN b.@communities DO
            IF NOT r.@communities.contains(s) THEN @@external += (s -> 1) END
        END;

    /* Per scored account, each node that is no leaf with the members sharing it, and those
       whose sharing start there is in the last 30 days; then the block. */
    NodeLinks = SELECT s FROM Scored:s
      POST-ACCUM
        FOREACH x IN s.@community DO
            FOREACH n IN @@shares.get(x.id) DO
                IF NOT @@leaf_ids.contains(n) THEN
                    s.@node_links += (n -> 1),
                    IF @@share_start.get(x.id).get(n) >= t_ms - 2592000000 THEN
                        s.@node_new_links += (n -> 1)
                    END
                END
            END
        END;
    Blocks = SELECT s FROM Scored:s
      POST-ACCUM
        INT nodes = 0, INT links = 0, INT new_links = 0, INT internal = 0, INT payments = 0,
        FOREACH (n, sharers) IN s.@node_links DO
            IF sharers >= 2 THEN
                nodes = nodes + 1,
                links = links + sharers,
                new_links = new_links + s.@node_new_links.get(n)
            END
        END,
        internal = @@internal.get(s.id),
        payments = @@internal.get(s.id) + @@external.get(s.id),
        s.@members += s.@community.size(),
        s.@capped += s.@proposed > s.@community.size(),
        s.@shared_nodes += nodes,
        IF nodes > 0 THEN
            s.@density += links * 1.0 / (s.@community.size() * nodes)
        END,
        IF links > 0 THEN s.@new_link_share_30d += new_links * 1.0 / links END,
        s.@internal_amount_30d += @@internal_cents.get(s.id),
        IF payments > 0 THEN s.@isolation += internal * 1.0 / payments END,
        s.@member_payments_30d += payments;

    PRINT "ok" AS status, "read_community-9c2ad9e04eda" AS version;
    PRINT Blocks[Blocks.id AS account_id, Blocks.@members AS members,
      Blocks.@capped AS capped, Blocks.@shared_nodes AS shared_nodes,
      Blocks.@density AS density, Blocks.@new_link_share_30d AS new_link_share_30d,
      Blocks.@internal_amount_30d AS internal_amount_30d, Blocks.@isolation AS isolation,
      Blocks.@member_payments_30d AS member_payments_30d] AS accounts;
}
